WEBVTT

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.940
The date is 1969.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:11.970
The setting is Japan in a period
of advanced economic growth.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:15.760
This is the story of those who protect
mankind from the grasp of invaders.

00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:18.350
This is the story
of the Gate Keepers.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:37.000
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:47.190
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.780
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:53.330
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.330
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:57.730
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:57.730 --> 00:01:00.290
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:05.900
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:08.600
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:08.970 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:15.040
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.750
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:22.020
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.390
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.160
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:33.300
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:37.240
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:40.040
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.270
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:46.580
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:53.110
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.340
An accident!

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:37.620
No, it was their doing.
It was the invaders.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.150
<i>Yes, they are after our planet.</i>

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:55.330
<i>Evil invaders reach greedily for
the beautiful blue planet, Earth!</i>

00:02:59.140 --> 00:02:59.900
<i>The transport plane explosion
at Haneda Airport today...</i>

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.870
<i>The transport plane explosion at Haneda Airport
today... Stop watching that,</i> will <i>you?</i>

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:03.470
<i>...It's suspected to be the work
of radicals...</i> What <i>are you doing?!</i>

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:06.770
<i>...Opposing the 1970 US Japan Peace Treaty.
Quit watching kids' shows! You're</i> in high school <i>now!</i>

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:10.950
<i>A report from the Metropolitan Polite Board says their hideout. ..
Wait, Saemi.</i> Watch <i>it for yourself and tell me it's</i> a <i>kids' show!</i>

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.850
<i>...in the city will be searched</i>

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.980
You'll love it, I swear!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.220
Hey! Stop it!

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:16.990
<i>...by twice as many investigators
as for an ordinary operation.</i>

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:18.250
<i>...by twice as many investigators as for an
ordinary operation. Don't change the channel, stupid!</i>

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.190
People can hear it from outside.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.820
<i>...are expected to conclude...
So</i> what?

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:24.230
I don't want anyone to
think I'm watching it.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.390
Who cares?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.230
I CARE!

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:36.170
My only two children, quarreling!
Your mother feels so pathetic!

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.210
I should get going.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.350
Bve Mom!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.420
Wait, I'm coming, too!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.750
Thanks for breakfast, Mom!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.910
Shun! Aren't you going to
say goodbye to your father?!

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:56.430
Why bother?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:04:00.430
I keep telling you, you
misjudged your father.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.560
It began when I gave birth to you.
Your mother remembers it well.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:06.800
You were such a difficult birth...

00:04:06.870 --> 00:04:09.840
...even the midwife had a hard time.
I was told you might die.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:12.280
Then your father suddenly
dashed out to the temple...

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:14.280
...to pray over and over for you...

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.810
Shun!

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.150
How is Mom?

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:25.210
What do you mean?
She's the same as always.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:27.220
Oh.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.720
Don't make your getaway without me.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.270
I can't help it. Once she
starts, she never lets up.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.940
I guess this place is
going to be buried, too.

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.340
Yeah.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:49.940
Once we got on a train right there
and went to Mikotama with Dad!

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:52.180
That was so boring,
I forgot about it!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.020
What are you sulking for?
You're like a little child.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:56.610
Look here, you...

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.880
Good morning, Mr. Matsuda!

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.590
Oh, good morning.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:03.220
Good morning!

00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:04.260
Morning.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.630
Are you stalled again?

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.500
That's right.
When your father was alive...

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:11.540
...he'd fix it up in a jiffy.

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.960
Oops, sorry.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.510
I'm going to school now.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:19.330
Okay, but watch out for cars!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:20.880
I'm not a child!

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.980
Well, Mr. Matsuda,
I have to go now, too.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:26.420
You do? Well, say hello
to your mother for me.

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.920
Tell her that the clothes she sewed
for me the other day are great.

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.460
I will.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.130
You...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.400
Six of the eight decoy
planes were destroyed.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:47.400
The sacrifice was too great.

00:06:09.060 --> 00:06:11.120
Is the land route safe?

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:14.930
Relax. We have a camouflage
operation ready for the land route.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:16.400
Camouflage operation?

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:19.930
Yes. That is why
I summoned her here.

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:26.310
Hello, I will be acting
as your tour guide.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:29.080
My name is Ruriko lkusawa.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:35.380
Thank you. Now everyone,
please turn to your right.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.980
There, we see the direct
monorail to Haneda Airport.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:44.260
It first opened 5 years ago,
on September 1964. Ever since...

00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:48.930
...it has been actively delivering
commuters from the downtown area...

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:51.800
...to the aerial gateway
of Japan, Haneda Airport.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:55.970
Now, please turn to your left.
What we see here, is...

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.550
Begin!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.060
When in trouble, the true athlete...

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:24.860
...delivers a tide-reversing
ultra cyclone chop!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.440
Hands!
The winner.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.010
Bye!

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.950
I'm starving!
Yeah, so am I!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.490
Ukiya!

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:41.780
Yes, sir?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:44.450
You came really close to
winning in kendo class today.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:48.460
Tell me about it! I came this close
to clobbering him with my killer move!

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:52.120
Why don't you join the kendo team
and learn starting with the basics?

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:55.460
Basics are for wimps.
MEN deliver high chops!

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.870
It's not cool to win
with tiny little slaps.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:03.870
If you join the kendo team and get
results, you could win a scholarship.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.110
That would probably make things
a little easier on your mother.

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:14.580
Nah, when it comes to exertion,
a part-time job is more my style.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:22.080
The main characters in sports manga
are usually from poor homes, right?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.720
It'll work out somehow.
Well, bye, teach!

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:28.760
I tried.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.480
What's this lousy ramen?
ls this pig slop?!

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.720
What?! But you drank every drop!

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:59.160
I was kind enough
to eat it, so pay me!

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.990
Y-You don't mean that!

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.700
All right, I'll let you
off easy this time.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:12.200
Hey, hey, hey!
I said get outa my way, you junk heap!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.980
How could you?  But, chief, you
said you would divorce your wife!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.180
I would never get serious
with a country bumpkin like you.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.990
Don't bother coming
to work tomorrow.

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.360
And this is my left hand...

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.620
I'm registering
paranormal frequencies!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.890
What?!

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.430
It's them!

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:10.540
Tategami Tours

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:06.490
Commence attack.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.220
Paper!

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.720
Paper. paper!

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:44.260
Your paper!

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:48.900
Mr. Matsuda?

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.430
Hi!

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.560
Commander!

00:11:53.640 --> 00:11:56.040
It can't be helped. Ms. lkusawa!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:57.600
Yes, sir!

00:11:57.680 --> 00:11:59.200
You can do it, right?

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:06.080
Yes, sir. I alone can
save us from this peril!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:13.720
Ruriko lkusawa of the Gate Keeper
team, heading out, sir!

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:15.680
We're counting on you!!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.730
Roger, AEGIS!

00:12:18.260 --> 00:12:19.730
What's that? Radicals?

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.590
Maybe they're shooting a movie?

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:30.040
GATE...

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:31.580
...OPEN!

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:54.500
It'll be okay, Ruriko.
You can do it!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.440
See, you did it!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.790
Amazing... with only a single shot.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:20.810
The gate for summoning massive
energy from other dimensions...

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:23.830
...one who can open the gate.
- A Gate Keeper!

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:27.090
She is the first member
of the gate keeper team...

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:31.190
...keeper of the Gate
of Life: Ruriko lkusawa.

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.840
Heave-ho!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.980
I'm really gonna let loose now!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:49.780
<i>Come back inside, Usawa.
We 're using this opportunity to escape.</i>

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:50.820
What? But there are still...

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.880
<i>Your physical strength
is also limited</i>

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.590
Roger, AEGIS.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.540
Commence fusion.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.250
Is it over already?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.290
You think this will
be on television?

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:44.680
Light of life.

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.110
My wounds...

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:55.450
That is her original gate ability,
the power of the Gate of Life.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.060
What could that be?

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:05.420
This is bad! They appear to have
morphed into combat formation.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:10.560
Thank you for your help.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:12.100
Look out!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:18.610
What is that?!

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:44.060
Oh, crap! It's heading
for the house!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.320
I will have to do it after all!

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:17.290
No matter how big it is...

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.460
...all my remaining arrows
should take care of it!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.540
It can't be!

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:38.960
Isn't my power enough?

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:43.960
Commander! The gate-ability
amplifier is reacting to something.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:47.000
What? There is no
motivation, so how?

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:50.000
Do you suppose it is
reacting to lkusawa's gate?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.630
No! That's an impossibility
at normal gate-ability levels.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:54.900
That's true...

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:59.380
Abnormal energy figures detected.
Danger level increase.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.050
Why, you!

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:07.680
Someone with such strong
gate ability is nearby?!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:16.850
That means there is someone with
stronger gate ability than I have?

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:24.730
I won't let you near my house!!

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.440
A gate!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.550
What?

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.710
Change of target.

00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:48.180
Fine! I'm over here, dummy!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.410
I know.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:09.110
In sports manga, once
the hero is in trouble...

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:14.680
...the basic premise
is to turn the tide.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:20.350
B- But it's never easy.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.630
Target down.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:38.130
Hey! You! Hold on!

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:39.770
Hey, you!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.780
C'mon! Snap out of it!

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:44.110
No way. Forget it.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:48.680
I don't want to join Dad.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:18:59.760
And you call yourself a gate keeper?!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.960
Wh...?

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.500
I'll give you the last of my power!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.210
So take responsibility.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.410
What?

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:27.320
The red iron ball is its weak spot.

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:29.690
Red iron ball...?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:34.990
Hey, who are you?

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:39.030
I... can't fight anymore.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:44.310
You are the only one
who can defeat it.

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.910
Hurry!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:52.720
I understand!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:56.450
The red iron ball, correct?!

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.890
That's right! You can do it!

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:02.260
LET ME AT IT!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.700
Re-detection of abnormal
energy figures.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.740
Attack the target.

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:20.710
Take that! And that!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.750
Ultra Cyclone chop!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.720
What... did l just do?

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:12.630
That is the power of the gate!

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:17.220
We have been looking
for someone like you.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:20.330
For someone with the
same ability she has.

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:23.240
The same ability as who?

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:24.830
You did well.

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:31.240
What is your name?

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:33.280
I'm Shun Ukiya.

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:38.310
Ukiya, we need your help.

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:41.790
In order to protect Earth
from the invaders.

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.920
I am asking you as commander
of the Far Eastern branch of...

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.960
...the Earth Defense Organization,
AEGIS. Please lend us your power.

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.300
As a warrior able to call
forth unlimited power...

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:02.310
...through gates said to
lead to unknown dimensions.

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.310
As a Gate Keeper!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:06.250
NO!

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.250
I thought you looked familiar!

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:11.020
Nol!

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:12.920
You're the one who lived near my
house when I was in kindergarten!

00:22:12.920 --> 00:22:15.390
- Stop it!! You're the one who lived near
my house when I was in kindergarten!

00:22:15.460 --> 00:22:17.950
...runny-nosed Rurippe!

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:39.030
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:39.030 --> 00:22:42.900
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:47.870
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:51.240
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:53.370
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:58.550
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:58.550 --> 00:23:01.880
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:06.510
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:07.220 --> 00:23:11.390
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:16.020
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:22.800
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
